					value: "Indicates whether the [element](https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#dfn-element) is exposed to an accessibility API. See related [\`aria-disabled\`](https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#aria-disabled)."
